              "type": "text",
              "text": "A circular table has radius 60 cm. A tablecloth must overhang by 15 cm on all sides. What is the area of the tablecloth to the nearest cm²? ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(Hint: find the radius of the tablecloth first.)",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
